  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1.25 cups white sugar",
    "2 teaspoons baking soda",
    "2 teaspoons ground cinnamon",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "2 cups shredded carrots",
    "1 apple - peeled, cored and shredded",
    "0.5 cup raisins",
    "0.5 cup chopped walnuts",
    "0.5 cup unsweetened flaked coconut",
    "3 large eggs",
    "1 cup vegetable oil",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 12-cup muffin tin or line cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix flour, sugar, baking soda, cinnamon, and salt together in a large bowl; stir in carrots, apple, raisins, walnuts, and coconut.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ixef7wwfDGl0t7FL9XWj_sSrOFU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20995-Easy-morning-glory-muffin-DDMFS-Step2-3x4-3259-9675849b3f274a0b8c70a6fd50695c32.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20995/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs, oil, and vanilla together in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f-Rax22ihjS0KGjqa8TuvUSJT28=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20995-Easy-morning-glory-muffin-DDMFS-Step3-3x4-3260-ce0712ac170942f998d34e8532c3db64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20995/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir egg mixture into the carrot mixture until just moistened.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lg44U6eZe7hcTT6F7vWiBnhVnL4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20995-Easy-morning-glory-muffin-DDMFS-Step4-3x4-3261-22d7168f96d44e69a634442ebe82580e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20995/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 2/3 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ri18YBv41bILgtjEdRWt-ZP58vk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20995-Easy-morning-glory-muffin-DDMFS-Step5-3x4-3263-89e521b59efc4374948ce9031e5fe999.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20995/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops spring back when lightly pressed, about 20 minutes. Cool in the tin for 5 minutes. Transfer to a wire rack to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nFCJVKvXmOuUCCJIG6PX43UXoPo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20995-Easy-morning-glory-muffin-DDMFS-Step6-3x4-3265-a7eae53d7c204a39a6b1e26db1b3d58a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20995/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
